## 1. Phased Roadmap

### Phase 0 — Foundation (Weeks 1-2)
- Fix existing code issues (duplicate ENCRYPTION_KEY, missing templates, .gitignore cleanup)
- Wire up Celery (`core/celery.py`, `core/__init__.py`)
- Switch to PostgreSQL
- Add missing templates for existing views
- Add DRF + JWT auth
- Implement contact/subscriber management
- Add `.env` to `.gitignore` and rotate secrets

### Phase 1 — Email Engine (Weeks 3-5)
- Actual campaign sending via Celery workers
- Email tracking (open/click pixels)
- Bounce handling
- Template editor (drag-drop + raw HTML)
- Contact lists with import/export (CSV)
- Subscriber management with segments
- Gmail API + Microsoft Graph API integration

### Phase 2 — AI Email Reply Agent (Weeks 5-7)
- AI provider abstraction layer (OpenAI, Claude, Gemini)
- Gmail inbox monitoring
- Email summarization + intent detection
- Reply generation with draft saving
- Human approval workflow
- Prompt template management
- AI memory/context per conversation thread

### Phase 3 — Social Media Management (Weeks 7-10)
- OAuth2 connections for all platforms
- Token refresh system
- Content publishing pipeline
- Scheduling with Celery Beat
- Analytics sync
- Multi-account dashboard

### Phase 4 — AI Content Studio (Weeks 9-12)
- Platform-specific content generation
- Caption/hashtag/CTA generation
- Carousel + video script generation
- Image prompt generation (DALL-E, Midjourney)
- Content review → approve → publish workflow
- Trend research agent

### Phase 5 — Media Asset Management (Weeks 11-13)
- Upload pipeline with CDN integration
- Folder/tag organization
- AI auto-tagging
- Image optimization pipeline
- Search/filter

### Phase 6 — Analytics & Scheduling (Weeks 13-15)
- Content calendar view
- Queue-based scheduling with timezone support
- Analytics aggregation pipeline
- Dashboard APIs + charts
- Campaign performance reports
- AI-powered insights

### Phase 7 — Notifications & Real-Time (Weeks 15-16)
- WebSocket infrastructure via Django Channels
- In-app notification center
- Email + Slack notification channels
- Real-time dashboard updates

### Phase 8 — Multi-Agent Orchestration (Weeks 16-18)
- Agent communication bus
- Shared context memory
- Workflow orchestration engine
- Prompt versioning + A/B testing
- Agent monitoring dashboard

### Phase 9 — SaaS Polish (Weeks 18-20)
- Subscription plans with Stripe
- Usage metering + rate limiting
- Tenant isolation hardening
- Audit log system
- API key management
- Developer documentation
- Performance optimization

