| Component | Scale Method | Initial | Growth |
|-----------|-------------|---------|--------|
| Web (Gunicorn) | Horizontal (containers) | 2 × 4 workers | 10+ containers behind LB |
| Celery Workers | Horizontal (per queue) | 3 workers | 5 high + 3 medium + 2 low |
| PostgreSQL | Vertical → Read replicas | 1 instance | 1 primary + 2 read replicas |
| Redis | Vertical → Cluster | 1 instance | Redis Cluster (3 nodes) |
| Media Storage | S3/R2 (inherently scalable) | 1 bucket | Multi-region buckets |
| Nginx | Load balancer | 1 instance | 2+ behind AWS ALB |
| Django Channels | Redis pub/sub + Daphne | 1 Daphne process | 3+ Daphne processes |

